            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Orders Over $95 Ship FREE",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Ships today or next day on most orders that are \"In Stock\". </strong> Some orders that are custom or large may take extra time to prepare.</p><ul><li><strong>Free shipping is 3-10 days and requires a purchase of $95 or more, or choose a faster method at checkout</strong>.  Be sure to account for the 0-2 days it will take us to pack and ship an order, in addition to the shipping speed you choose.</li><li><strong>All orders ship as soon as possible</strong>.  We don't like waiting and you probably don't either.</li><li><strong>Any delays will be shown:</strong> If the item is back-ordered it will show on the product page, at the cart page, and the checkout page. We are on your side. </li><li>Shipping times are estimations.  Items that are custom, delayed, rejected, or affected by other acts of god will take additional time.</li></ul>"
